| Milestone | Rule Type | Key Parameters | Justification |
|-----------|-----------|----------------|---------------|
| find_crafting_table | position_near_with_facing | target=(4,0,3), dist≤16, facing≤60° | Standard find-task rule; crafting table confirmed visible at step_005 and step_019 |
